# define your env variables for the test env here
KERNEL_CLASS='App\Kernel'
# At least 32 bytes, because AccessTokens refuses to be constructed with less and signs with HS256.
# APP_ENV=test is the one environment where this tree's messaging actually runs (in-memory channels),
# so a secret the token service rejects makes the whole container unbuildable there. Fixed rather
# than random: a test secret is not a secret, and a value that changes per checkout would make a
# token minted by one run unverifiable by the next.
APP_SECRET=
